data:{"type":"ACTIVITY_SNAPSHOT","runId":"r1","threadId":"slides-1786758143-1","timestamp":1786758168252,"messageId":"a2ui-slides","activityType":"a2ui-surface","content":{"a2ui_operations":[{"version":"v0.9","createSurface":{"surfaceId":"slides","catalogId":"https://opencode-agui-app.local/a2ui/data-agent-catalog.json"}},{"version":"v0.9","updateComponents":{"surfaceId":"slides","components":[{"component":"Markdown","id":"md-0","text":"- 8月1日–13日累计销售额 ¥1,360,700，共 137 笔订单\n- 日均销售额约 ¥104,669，笔记本贡献 45%（¥615,912）居首\n- 头部两区域（华北、华东）合计占比超 55%\n"},{"component":"Text","id":"note-0","variant":"caption","text":"🎤 数据来源：workspace/sales-2026-08.csv，统计期 8月1日–13日"},{"component":"Column","id":"col-0","children":["md-0","note-0"]},{"component":"Card","id":"slide-0","child":"col-0"},{"component":"Markdown","id":"md-1","text":"- 华北 ¥388,082 领跑，华东 ¥366,096 紧随其后\n- 华中 ¥285,225 居第三，西南、华南均低于 ¥18 万\n- 华北+华东合计 ¥754,178，占总销售额 55.4%\n"},{"component":"Column","id":"col-1","children":["md-1"]},{"component":"Card","id":"slide-1","child":"col-1"},{"component":"Markdown","id":"md-2","text":"- 笔记本 ¥615,912 为绝对主力，占 45.3%\n- 手机 ¥347,913（25.6%）、平板 ¥228,712（16.8%）跟随\n- 耳机仅 ¥55,738（4.1%），为最弱品类\n"},{"component":"Column","id":"col-2","children":["md-2"]},{"component":"Card","id":"slide-2","child":"col-2"},{"component":"Markdown","id":"md-3","text":"- 深挖华北、华东大客户，复制笔记本高客单价打法\n- 西南、华南可加强手机/平板营销，缩小与头部区域差距\n- 耳机与智能手表等低价品类可做捆绑促销以提升连带率\n"},{"component":"Column","id":"col-3","children":["md-3"]},{"component":"Card","id":"slide-3","child":"col-3"},{"component":"Tabs","id":"slides-tabs","tabs":[{"title":"1. 总览","child":"slide-0"},{"title":"2. 区域表现","child":"slide-1"},{"title":"3. 品类分析","child":"slide-2"},{"title":"4. 建议","child":"slide-3"}]},{"component":"Text","id":"title","variant":"h3","text":"2026年8月销售分析"},{"component":"Column","id":"root","children":["title","slides-tabs"]}]}}]},"replace":true}

